DESCRIPTION:This year's Graduate Liberal Studies Student Showcase will be 
 held on Thursday\, April 30\, 5:00 - 7:00 PM in the auditorium at The Cen
 ter for Documentary Studies. The opening reception will take place in the
  Lindhurst Building. The ceremony will proceed to the downstairs auditori
 um. Please view parking information here. \n\nThe annual Student Showcase
  is funded by proceeds from a generous bequest to GLS from our alumna Lot
 tie Applewhite (1924-2017\; MALS '97).  Every spring before graduation\, 
 the Showcase offers an opportunity to highlight student work through both
  master's projects and other research and educational activities funded w
 ith support from the program's Applewhite Award Grants.
DURATION:PT2H
